
GK Security Platform
Production-ready security starter for Spring Boot applications.

Features

✅ JWT Authentication

✅ OAuth2 / OpenID Connect

✅ Azure AD Integration

✅ Keycloak Integration

✅ AWS Cognito Integration

✅ Authentication Audit Logs

✅ OpenTelemetry Tracing

✅ Micrometer Metrics

✅ Grafana Dashboards

✅ Multi Factor Authentication

✅ Fine-Grained Permissions

✅ Zero Boilerplate

Quick Start

Add dependency

com.gk gk-security-starter
Configure

gk: security: provider: jwt

Run

mvn spring-boot:run

Done.


